    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lanesplitterz is a 3D arcade-style bowling game where you compete to rule over Neo Las Vegas, the last remaining city in the aftermath of a nuclear winter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this extreme evolution of bowling, thrill-seeking daredevils shoot themselves from cannons down the Vegas strip toward bowling pins the size of buildings. Face off against the city's top Lanesplitterz in a battle against corruption to win the tournament and become the King!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOWL:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the ball as you bowl against 3 unique anime-style bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> CHALLENGE:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience each boss' dramatic story, each with custom over-the top character art, special abilities, and custom music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> DOMINATE:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Neo Las Vegas from the tyrannical rule of King Julius Caesar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lanesplitterz is a 3D arcade-style bowling game where you compete to rule over Neo Las Vegas, the last remaining city in the aftermath of a nuclear winter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this extreme evolution of bowling, thrill-seeking daredevils shoot themselves from cannons down the Vegas strip toward bowling pins the size of buildings. Face off against the city's top Lanesplitterz in a battle against corruption to win the tournament and become the King!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BOWL:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the ball as you bowl against 3 unique anime-style bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> CHALLENGE:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience each boss' dramatic story, each with custom over-the top character art, special abilities, and custom music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> DOMINATE:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save Neo Las Vegas from the tyrannical rule of King Julius Caesar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
